<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Bank of Qld 2 mths lending up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Bank of Qld 2 mths lending up 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Queensland Ltd said on Thursday the first two months to the year to August 31, 1997 recorded lending growth of 30 percent.</p>
</text>
